                                                "text": "\"Well, Johnny,\" she replied, rather hurt, \"if you want to call me something else, you may do so; but I will not have any outlandish, ridiculous names. I don't like it much, but if you really wish it, you may call me Polly.\"\nPolly, indeed! Mary was getting more and more prosaic."
